        "TileImage": "$($repository b3d3d11c-989d-414c-86a6-700fff65b536).Image",
        "Description": "Johanus W. Dicksalot from channel 16, we have incoming news of a reported ´threat´. Apparently according to some bysatnders , it appears that someone had airdropped everyone in the building a message:´five of you will die today.....´. Although we are unsure if this is real or not , we will keep you on edge! \rSo, the question remains:Is this just some sick teenage prank or a true threat?\r\r\r\r\r\r-i might be shakespear",
